ːro2_robotː A new short challenge is now available, along with a host of other improvements, including:


 Expanded introduction;
 Visual style enhancements;
 Addition of missing hints;
 Character acceleration with double-click;
 Improved settings menu;
 Bug fixes and much more!

Please report any errors or issues in our Steam community! Your feedback helps us make the game better.

Episode 2 Page 🔗

First of all, many thanks to Tausret! She responded to this ad:


steamcommunity.com/app/1432680/discussions/0/3414304680782292425 She helped us with the German localization ! Thanks to her, another nation has joined our friendly community — Welcome!


Besides German localization was added improvements:

 - Fixed  some bugs and flaws;
 - Added another mini-game in the Drains Level;
- Added missing task with an umbrella in the Drains;
- Some art improvements.

In honor of this event, there will be a 30% discount on all game content for the whole week!
